# Casino API Test Cases

## 1. Login and Authentication

| ID | Test Scenario | Expected Result |
|---|---|---|
| TC-001 | Login with valid credentials | Login succeeds and access/refresh tokens are returned |
| TC-002 | Login with an incorrect password | Request is rejected with an appropriate error |
| TC-003 | Login with a non-existent user | Request is rejected |
| TC-004 | Access a protected endpoint without a token | Access is denied |
| TC-005 | Access a protected endpoint with an invalid token | Access is denied |
| TC-006 | Use an expired access token | Access is denied until a valid token is obtained |
| TC-007 | Refresh an access token using a valid refresh token | A new access token is returned |
| TC-008 | Refresh using an invalid refresh token | Token refresh is rejected |

